# Salary service database configuration (task 3.3: the credential the student
# finds after the initial foothold). @@SECRET@@ is replaced by entrypoint.sh on
# every container start, so the value is never in the image. Readable by group
# 'report' (the foothold accounts), which is the finding.
db.host=127.0.0.1
db.port=5432
db.name=salary
db.user=salary_admin
db.password=@@SECRET@@
